# protobuf-net's [ProtoModel] calls SerializerCache.Get<TProvider, TSelf> for each value object, whose
# [DynamicallyAccessedMembers] demands every member of TSelf, its nested types included: the System.Text.Json and
# TypeDescriptor converters the generator nests in every value object, whose members reflect. Reported where the model
# protobuf-net generates calls it, by the analyzer and by the AOT compiler.
\.ProtoModel\.g\.cs\([0-9,]+\): (Trim analysis |AOT analysis )?warning IL(2026|2111|3050): .*'System\.ComponentModel\.
\.ProtoModel\.g\.cs\([0-9,]+\): (Trim analysis |AOT analysis )?warning IL(2026|2111|3050): .*'System\.Text\.Json\.Serialization\.JsonConverter\.ConfigureJsonTypeInfoUsingReflection\(
# protobuf-net.Core warns for itself.
protobuf-net\.Core\.dll : warning IL(2104|3053): Assembly 'protobuf-net\.Core'
